{#
  The identity of traefik's bouncer-key precheck, `bouncer-key.yaml.j2` beside it. It renders
  even when `traefik_k8s_bouncer_key_precheck` is false, so `traefik-precheck` exists, and
  `traefik` depends on it, before the Job does.

  It is a ServiceAccount with no Role: the Job talks to the LAPI over HTTP and calls no
  Kubernetes API, so its pod mounts no token.
#}
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: traefik-precheck
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
automountServiceAccountToken: false
